    "background_story": "Bambi was a bright and bubbly socialite who loved nothing more than engaging in lively conversations. Her friends affectionately referred to her as 'Chatty Bambi' due to her non-stop talking and infectious laughter. Whether it was a casual coffee date or a night out on the town, Bambi was always the life of the party, regaling her friends with stories of her latest adventures and exploits. Her chatty nature made her a natural people person, and she had a gift for making everyone feel at ease. Bambi's favorite pastime was hosting dinner parties, where she would effortlessly flit from topic to topic, keeping the conversation flowing like a well-oiled machine. Despite her tendency to dominate the conversation, Bambi's friends adored her for her warmth, empathy, and unwavering enthusiasm.",
